Z||000000||Elvira||10-14-2001||04:26 PM||||How was the Leaf Peeper's Tour this year?  Chester's car is down for now so we couldn't make it this year and was just wondering how it went? How many were there?<P>------------------<BR>Elvira<BR>Blue 87GT<BR>Black 86GT 5sp x 2<BR>86SC t-top 58k miles||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jaygee79||10-14-2001||04:49 PM||||It was fun.  There were 7 cars.  There was me and Josh, Ray and his wife, Steve and Tarrah, Russel and his wife, Eric and Beth, Dave, and Phil and Gwen.<P>We passed a car show with some really nice cars.  And we had a couple people at red lights compliment our cars  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>We really need to invest in some of those handheld radios though.  It was hard to keep track of everyone and know when to stop.  We had a great time at the car museum and candle shop.  We didn't have enough time to shop much though.  That place is huge.||||reg||1
Z||000002||88CoupeV6||10-14-2001||06:05 PM||||It was great   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Sorry that you guys couldn't make it. Hope you guys can come to the dinner in the intrepid   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>We also saw 2 Fieros and beeped and waved. One even followed us for a while and talked to Dave.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig.jpg">     <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A><p>[This message has been edited by 88CoupeV6 (edited 10-14-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000003||MsBeth||10-15-2001||10:36 AM||||It was great!  The foliage was beautiful and the company was perfect except we missed you guys  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.  <P>The museum was amazing and the candle factory is something that has to be seen to be believed, it is huge.<P>I got my pics back yesterday - I will try to get them over to Boomtastic this week so he can scan and post them.  <P>BTW Josh and Jaime- I have copies of the ones of us in the cars for you guys.  And copies of Tarah and Steves photos too.  <P>It was great to see everyone. After the tour Boomtastic and I had dinner with Ray,Janet and Dave at this cute little place - you know what that means Elvira lol- the waitress thanked Boomtastic after dinner for making her day  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blue_2.gif">  <P>MsBeth||||reg||7
